    /// <description>
    /// the family's LID head produced a non-language sentinel for this
    /// audio (e.g. SenseVoice's &lt;|nospeech|>).
    /// </description>
    /// </item>
    /// </list>
    /// <para>
    /// Returned pointer is owned by the session. See "Result text-pointer
